    {
      "source": "Used to build a <a href=\"TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a> from a property location. The built\n<code>TypeDescriptor</code> can then be used to convert from/to the property type.",
      "translation": "用于从属性位置构建一个 <a href=\"TypeDescriptor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>TypeDescriptor</code></a>。构建后的 <code>TypeDescriptor</code> 可用于在属性类型之间进行转换。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The property getter method: for example, <code>getFoo()</code>.",
      "translation": "属性获取器方法：例如，<code>getFoo()</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The property type: for example, <code>java.lang.String</code>.",
      "translation": "属性类型：例如，<code>java.lang.String</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The property setter method: for example, <code>setFoo(String)</code>.",
      "translation": "属性设置方法：例如，<code>setFoo(String)</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The name of the property: for example, 'foo'.",
      "translation": "属性名称：例如，'foo'。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The object declaring this property, either directly or in a superclass the object extends.",
      "translation": "声明此属性的对象，无论是直接声明还是在对象扩展的父类中声明。",
      "count": 2
    },
